WEBVTT

00:07:59.850 --> 00:08:01.852
has become an unabashed advocate

00:08:01.852 --> 00:08:03.437
for men to learn

00:08:03.437 --> 00:08:07.441
and actively change behaviors
regarding sexual and physical violence.

00:08:08.984 --> 00:08:09.985
There is hope;

00:08:09.985 --> 00:08:10.986
there is light.

00:08:12.279 --> 00:08:14.490
Men around the world
are putting in the work

00:08:14.490 --> 00:08:16.784
to catalyze a true gender reckoning.

00:08:18.035 --> 00:08:19.203
But far more are needed.

00:08:20.412 --> 00:08:22.331
What I want to say to you today is this.

00:08:24.041 --> 00:08:25.042
Too many of us --

00:08:25.042 --> 00:08:26.669
too many men --

00:08:26.669 --> 00:08:28.629
don’t understand

00:08:28.629 --> 00:08:30.422
that equity,